    "https://www.yhc.edu/pay-for-college/tuition-and-fees/pay-deposit/": {
      "title": "Pay Deposit",
      "description": "Pay Deposit - Young Harris College Skip to content Academics Admissions Pay for College Athletics Deposit Visit YHC Apply Give Menu Search Close Menu More About About Calendar Leadership Mission and goals Student Achievement Quick facts Consumer information History Safety and security Maps and directions Sustainability News Institutional Review Board More Academics Academics Majors and minors Departments Academic calendar Academic support Study Away Library Learn online Mountain Lion 1000 Dual Enrollment Honors Research Request a transcript More Admissions Admissions Apply Visit YHC Alumni Athletics More Pay for College Pay for College Tuition and fees Financial aid Scholarships Work-study More Student Life Student Life Residence life Clubs and activities Greek life Health and wellness Religious life Disability services Career services Search Search Button Request Info Visit YHC Apply Give Information for: Mountain Lion Central Commencement Parents and families Community Employees Campus Gate Art Gallery YHC Box Office Directory Connect with us: Facebook Instagram Twitter Flickr YouTube LinkedIn Home > Pay for College > Tuition and fees > Pay Deposit Pay Deposit Deposit submissions require a Student ID number. ID numbers are located on your acceptance letter and admissions portal. Enter ‘P’ before the Student ID. Enrollment deposit: $300 If you have been accepted in the upcoming class and you are ready to become a Mountain Lion, you can submit your $300 enrollment deposit to secure your spot! Use the link below to send your deposit electronically through our safe and secure online payment system. Deposits are refundable until May 1 for fall enrollment and November 1 for spring enrollment. The deposit consists of a $100 new student orientation fee and $200 enrollment deposit. Ready to submit your deposit? Deposit Graduate deposit: $200 Upon acceptance, new graduate students should submit a payment of $200. Use the link below to send your deposit electronically through our safe and secure online payment system. Ready to submit your deposit? Deposit Request Info Visit Apply 1 College Street Young Harris, GA 30582 (800) 241-3754 Information for: Mountain Lion Central Commencement Parents and families Community Employees Campus Gate Art Gallery YHC Box Office Directory About Calendar Academics Admissions Alumni Athletics News Pay for college Careers at Young Harris Planetarium Library Student life Directory Policies and procedures Title IX Connect with us: Facebook Instagram Twitter Flickr YouTube LinkedIn © 2024 Young Harris College"
