    "https://www.yhc.edu/academics/academic-support/career-and-professional-development/": {
      "title": "From First-Year to Forever:\nCareer Support That Stays With You",
      "description": "Career Services and Professional Development - Young Harris College Skip to content Academics Admissions Pay for College Athletics Deposit Visit YHC Apply Give Menu Search Close Menu More About About Calendar Leadership Mission and goals Student Achievement Quick facts Consumer information History Safety and security Maps and directions Sustainability News Institutional Review Board More Academics Academics Majors and minors Departments Academic calendar Academic support Study Away Library Learn online Mountain Lion 1000 Dual Enrollment Honors Research Request a transcript More Admissions Admissions Apply Visit YHC Alumni Athletics More Pay for College Pay for College Tuition and fees Financial aid Scholarships Work-study More Student Life Student Life Residence life Clubs and activities Greek life Health and wellness Religious life Disability services Career services Search Search Button Request Info Visit YHC Apply Give Information for: Mountain Lion Central Commencement Parents and families Community Employees Campus Gate Art Gallery YHC Box Office Directory Connect with us: Facebook Instagram Twitter Flickr YouTube LinkedIn Rooted Here. Ready for Anywhere. From First-Year to Forever:\nCareer Support That Stays With You Make an Appointment Handshake Appointment Guide See Resources Exploration & Planning Platforms Find Internships & Campus Jobs PREP Internships and Campus Jobs Want to get experience while you’re still in school? YHC’s Career and Professional Development Office makes it easy to find internships that match your career goals and campus jobs that fit your schedule. You’ll earn money, build skills, and explore what you enjoy—all with support from staff who can help you apply, prepare, and make the most of every opportunity. Make Appt with Handshake Handshake Appointment Guide Student Resources All Things Resume Action Verb list Cover Letter Example Cover Letter Guide Do’s and Don’ts Resume Guide Graduate School Graduate and Professional School Graduate School Test Prep Internship Internship, Jobs, and Volunteering Interviewing Guide Networking Guide Career and Professional Development Platforms​ Expert styling for interviews, tracking and assessing your career, and more!​​ Handshake Book time with a Career Counselor, check out jobs and internships on or off campus, and see what career events are coming up. Make an Appointment Expert Stylist & Outfit With Luke’s Career Closet , you can meet with a stylist to talk about what you need and get a complete professional outfit mailed to you within a week Get Your Interview-Ready Outfit Focus 2 Careers Utilize Focus 2 Careers valid and reliable career assessments and career readiness tools to understand what careers your personality, values, and skills match best. YHC’s unique ACCESS CODE is: mountainlions Discover Your Career Measure Your Progress, Master New Skills​ Using Suitable , keep track of how you’re doing in your classes, campus job, or internship, check where your skills stand on a national scale, and find out where you can improve. I Want To Be Career-Ready What Can I Do With This Major?​ Check out What Can I Do with This Major? to see the different career paths and opportunities that can come from any major you choose. Explore Careers Be Interview Ready Big Interview is an online tool that helps you get ready for job interviews. It gives you step-by-step training, lets you practice with mock interviews, and even uses AI to give you feedback on your answers and resume. Practice for Interviews Four-Year Career Plan Use the Four-Year Career Plan to stay on track each year at YHC and build the skills and experiences you’ll need for career success after graduation. Get Your Plan Get Real and Relevant Career Advice from a Mentor The YHC Mentoring Program connects you with alumni who’ve been in your shoes and can offer advice, support, and encouragement as you figure out your next steps. Through Mentor Collective, you can be matched with a mentor who fits your goals and interests and who can help you grow personally and professionally. Find Your Mentor \"I secured a job before I even finished my\nundergraduate degree at YHC!\" \"Thanks to their support and the careful focus on the small details of my resume, work experience, and the position listings I was applying for, I secured a job before I even finished my undergraduate degree at YHC!\" Brady Swanson, '25 \"I owe much of my early career success to the incredible support and guidance I received from career services at Young Harris. The staff goes above and beyond to invest in students' futures, and the variety of opportunities they provide makes a real difference.\" Nicole Klutcharich, '25 Launch Your Next Chapter Make An Appointment Handshake Appointment Guide Request Info Visit Apply 1 College Street Young Harris, GA 30582 (800) 241-3754 Information for: Mountain Lion Central Commencement Parents and families Community Employees Campus Gate Art Gallery YHC Box Office Directory About Calendar Academics Admissions Alumni Athletics News Pay for college Careers at Young Harris Planetarium Library Student life Directory Policies and procedures Title IX Connect with us: Facebook Instagram Twitter Flickr YouTube LinkedIn © 2024 Young Harris College"
    },
